Third-party notices for the Akuma devbox image
==============================================

The devbox stages the standard Akuma userspace (busybox, apk, tcc, scratch, meow,
etc.) from Alpine packages and from the submodules listed in .gitmodules; each
keeps its own licence (busybox and apk-tools-static: GPL-2.0; tcc: LGPL-2.1).

Notices for code derived from or linked into Akuma itself are in the repository's
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
